WEBVTT

01:35.840 --> 01:40.800
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.610 --> 01:43.940
[Episode 18]

02:06.230 --> 02:06.790
Your Highness.

02:06.790 --> 02:07.650
Your Highness.

02:16.800 --> 02:17.460
Ning Fei...

02:18.870 --> 02:19.430
is gone.

02:22.079 --> 02:22.810
Impossible.

02:23.870 --> 02:24.870
How could that be?

02:24.960 --> 02:26.450
He was fine when I saw him in prison.

02:26.450 --> 02:27.980
That's what Yixiao told me.

02:31.620 --> 02:32.610
But I think Yixiao

02:32.610 --> 02:33.870
might have been lying,

02:34.470 --> 02:35.520
because Ning Fei was gravely injured

02:35.520 --> 02:37.380
by people sent by Empress Zhuang.

02:37.800 --> 02:39.050
If anything had happened to him,

02:39.050 --> 02:40.000
given Yixiao's temper,

02:40.000 --> 02:41.030
she would have turned Yujing City

02:41.030 --> 02:42.150
upside down.

02:42.910 --> 02:44.770
There's no way she'd be this calm.

02:45.240 --> 02:47.120
The fact that the Three Heroes of Jinxiu

02:47.120 --> 02:48.250
ended up like this

02:48.910 --> 02:49.840
was all my fault.

02:52.120 --> 02:54.120
I insisted on getting rid of Yixiao.

03:02.150 --> 03:03.080
Send some people

03:03.430 --> 03:04.430
to quietly look into

03:04.430 --> 03:05.830
Ning Fei's whereabouts.

03:07.030 --> 03:07.520
Yes.

03:24.800 --> 03:25.530
How is she?

03:26.900 --> 03:27.829
What do you mean?

03:28.190 --> 03:29.150
What do you think?

03:29.150 --> 03:30.430
You didn't listen to me.

03:30.430 --> 03:31.910
I told you not to use force,
but you did anyway.

03:31.910 --> 03:33.079
And now you're asking me how it is?

03:33.079 --> 03:34.630
Don't you know the answer yourself?

03:34.630 --> 03:35.280
Lord Ling,

03:35.630 --> 03:37.000
the situation was urgent at the time.

03:37.000 --> 03:38.630
I didn't think it through.

03:39.120 --> 03:40.710
She got hurt because of

03:40.960 --> 03:42.290
your urgent situation?

03:45.710 --> 03:46.280
Father,

03:46.370 --> 03:48.000
this isn't the time for such talk.

03:48.000 --> 03:49.400
Hurry and check Yixiao's injury.

03:49.400 --> 03:51.190
Don't I need to understand the situation?

03:51.190 --> 03:51.960
Can it be as easy

03:51.960 --> 03:52.750
as you say?

03:53.000 --> 03:53.870
Can a solution really be

03:53.870 --> 03:55.070
that easy to think of?

03:56.800 --> 03:58.860
I've actually thought of a solution.

03:59.630 --> 04:00.190
Father,

04:00.260 --> 04:01.630
what solution? Tell us.

04:01.680 --> 04:03.140
Don't keep us in suspense.

04:03.240 --> 04:03.800
Alright.

04:04.840 --> 04:05.430
But I don't dare

04:05.430 --> 04:06.640
use it lightly.

04:06.680 --> 04:08.630
It's not as simple
as treating muscle and bone injuries.

04:08.630 --> 04:11.360
It's like scraping the bone
to remove the poison.

04:11.840 --> 04:13.120
Scraping the bone?

04:16.260 --> 04:18.329
We need to cut through the flesh here

04:18.459 --> 04:19.860
to repair the meridians.

04:19.870 --> 04:20.800
If all goes well,

04:20.920 --> 04:22.390
she'll recover full mobility.

04:22.390 --> 04:23.120
If not,

04:24.150 --> 04:25.390
she'll be crippled for life.

04:25.390 --> 04:26.870
Cutting through the flesh?

04:26.870 --> 04:27.870
Wouldn't that make the injury even worse?

04:27.870 --> 04:29.130
What do you know?

04:29.360 --> 04:30.950
Her injury is in the meridians and bones.

04:30.950 --> 04:32.000
You think a bit of ointment on the skin

04:32.000 --> 04:33.510
would heal it?

04:37.480 --> 04:38.100
Miss,

04:38.570 --> 04:39.360
don't worry.

04:39.510 --> 04:40.750
After taking the anesthetic,

04:40.750 --> 04:42.409
you'll just sleep through it.

04:42.560 --> 04:43.720
But it will hurt a lot

04:44.920 --> 04:45.850
when you wake up.

04:48.390 --> 04:49.080
No.

04:49.110 --> 04:50.350
Think of another way.

04:51.270 --> 04:52.070
It's alright.

04:52.360 --> 04:53.070
I trust you.

06:46.070 --> 06:47.159
The First Prince let the princess

06:47.159 --> 06:49.360
and her husband go without permission.

06:49.950 --> 06:50.870
Perhaps

06:51.720 --> 06:54.350
he has been secretly in contact
with Jinxiu.

06:54.830 --> 06:57.020
The Prince Consort's
returning to his country

06:57.020 --> 06:59.280
is understandable.

06:59.380 --> 07:01.810
He could have reported it to you.

07:01.870 --> 07:04.360
You wouldn't have refused his request.

07:07.000 --> 07:08.330
Prime Minister Zhuang.

07:08.800 --> 07:10.530
Don't you have anything to say?

07:14.720 --> 07:16.430
This matter seems suspicious.

07:16.430 --> 07:18.040
We should wait for the First Prince
to return

07:18.040 --> 07:19.900
and explain everything clearly.

07:19.920 --> 07:21.650
Has the First Prince returned?

07:23.560 --> 07:24.510
Your Majesty,

07:25.190 --> 07:27.390
he entered the city early this morning.

07:28.160 --> 07:29.490
He's back in the capital

07:30.680 --> 07:32.150
but hasn't come to report?

07:33.070 --> 07:35.200
Summon him to the palace immediately!

07:35.430 --> 07:36.120
Yes.

07:52.830 --> 07:53.690
Your Highness,

07:53.750 --> 07:55.950
His Majesty summoned you to the palace.

07:56.950 --> 07:58.510
Greetings, Your Highness.

08:03.120 --> 08:03.830
How is she?

08:06.560 --> 08:07.390
She won't die.

08:13.040 --> 08:13.820
This...

08:14.680 --> 08:15.190
His Highness

08:15.190 --> 08:16.600
has some affairs to attend to.

08:16.600 --> 08:18.160
Sir, please wait a moment.

08:53.000 --> 08:53.860
Your Highness,

08:54.040 --> 08:55.710
the palace attendant is waiting for you.

08:55.710 --> 08:56.820
Tell him to wait.

08:58.320 --> 09:01.320
I'll personally apologize
to His Majesty afterward.

09:22.870 --> 09:23.670
Your Majesty,

09:24.280 --> 09:26.520
shall we discuss it tomorrow?

09:27.360 --> 09:28.870
When will he arrive?

09:39.030 --> 09:39.960
Where is His Highness?

09:39.960 --> 09:41.720
That female general of Jinxiu is injured.

09:41.720 --> 09:43.750
Stop whispering.

09:46.360 --> 09:47.670
Just tell me directly.

09:50.550 --> 09:51.350
Your Majesty,

09:51.360 --> 09:52.600
His Highness...

09:53.030 --> 09:53.960
Tell me.

09:57.720 --> 09:58.880
Say it right there!

10:00.200 --> 10:02.480
His Highness is handling urgent matters
at his residence

10:02.480 --> 10:05.140
and cannot respond to your summon
immediately.

10:06.910 --> 10:09.360
Cannot respond to my summon?

10:10.240 --> 10:11.360
Didn't you ask him

10:12.240 --> 10:14.100
what matter in this world could be

10:14.150 --> 10:16.410
more important than seeing His Majesty?

10:19.030 --> 10:19.720
Your Majesty!

10:19.720 --> 10:20.480
The...

10:20.480 --> 10:21.750
female general of Jinxiu
at First Prince's Residence

10:21.750 --> 10:23.350
has been seriously injured.

10:23.670 --> 10:26.800
The First Prince is staying by her side
to watch over her.

11:05.350 --> 11:07.010
Her left arm must not be moved,

11:07.030 --> 11:09.090
and her shoulder wound must stay dry.

11:10.000 --> 11:11.060
Thank you for this,

11:11.840 --> 11:12.770
Young Mistress.

11:13.140 --> 11:14.670
You should thank my father.

11:14.840 --> 11:15.800
In all my life,

11:15.870 --> 11:17.200
I've only seen him perform

11:17.200 --> 11:19.360
this meridian restoration technique twice.

11:19.360 --> 11:20.760
It takes immense effort.

11:21.020 --> 11:22.050
After today,

11:22.790 --> 11:23.840
he'll probably need several days

11:23.840 --> 11:25.440
to fully recover his energy.

11:25.910 --> 11:27.370
I'll remember this favor.

11:28.360 --> 11:29.360
Don't mention it.

11:30.120 --> 11:31.440
Just take good care of my sister.

11:31.440 --> 11:34.040
There's still a risk
of permanent disability.

12:22.720 --> 12:24.060
Mr. Ma came personally.

12:29.870 --> 12:30.640
What?

12:31.630 --> 12:33.080
Was he afraid I wouldn't follow the order,

12:33.080 --> 12:35.140
so he sent you to drag me to the palace?

12:35.320 --> 12:36.720
This is no joke this time.

12:36.910 --> 12:38.640
Be careful when you talk to him.

12:42.300 --> 12:44.230
Thank you for your trouble, Mr. Ma.

12:58.310 --> 12:59.770
His Majesty didn't sleep all night,

12:59.770 --> 13:00.600
and today in the hall

13:00.600 --> 13:01.810
he was truly angered.

13:01.940 --> 13:02.960
Only because of
the court officials' presence

13:02.960 --> 13:04.360
did he restrain himself.

13:04.630 --> 13:05.790
Your Highness, please be understanding.

13:05.790 --> 13:07.020
His Majesty is getting on in years.

13:07.020 --> 13:08.440
Just let him scold you a bit

13:08.440 --> 13:09.360
and don't argue with him,

13:09.360 --> 13:11.090
or you'll make him angry again.

13:15.050 --> 13:16.990
[Zichen Hall]

13:17.840 --> 13:19.550
Since Prince of Zhennan arrived,

13:19.550 --> 13:21.440
His Majesty has lost
his appetite and sleep—

13:21.440 --> 13:22.970
truly wearing himself out.

13:23.150 --> 13:23.870
I see.

13:25.420 --> 13:30.120
[Zichen Hall]

14:04.710 --> 14:05.830
I, Feng Suige,

14:06.360 --> 14:08.090
pay my respects to His Majesty.

14:10.630 --> 14:12.020
Rise.

14:12.600 --> 14:13.630
I am guilty.

14:16.120 --> 14:17.920
Your Majesty, please punish me.

14:25.510 --> 14:26.870
Rise and speak.

14:34.440 --> 14:36.250
When Xiyang was seven,

14:36.360 --> 14:37.790
she accompanied me on an incognito tour.

14:37.790 --> 14:38.450
I don't know

14:38.480 --> 14:40.150
which rascal

14:40.360 --> 14:41.360
she got this from.

14:42.360 --> 14:43.960
She treasured it immensely.

14:44.840 --> 14:46.870
She cherished it

14:46.870 --> 14:48.670
far more than
all her gem- and pearl-encrusted

14:48.670 --> 14:50.080
trinkets.

14:54.510 --> 14:56.550
Are you resenting me?

14:57.360 --> 14:59.020
I failed to bring Xiyang back,

15:00.030 --> 15:01.720
so I deserve punishment.

15:03.550 --> 15:05.670
I told you to rise,

15:06.480 --> 15:08.010
yet you're still kneeling?

15:09.240 --> 15:10.270
Stand up!

15:24.510 --> 15:26.440
Xiyang has always been thoughtful

15:26.600 --> 15:28.080
since she was a child.

15:29.260 --> 15:31.640
I injured my shoulder years ago.

15:32.110 --> 15:33.050
She knows that

15:33.440 --> 15:36.000
whenever it rains,
my old injury flares up,

15:37.000 --> 15:39.080
and my shoulder aches unbearably.

15:40.440 --> 15:42.320
So whenever it rains,

15:42.480 --> 15:44.080
she comes to keep me company,

15:44.840 --> 15:46.510
bringing candies

15:46.840 --> 15:48.030
and talking with me

15:48.910 --> 15:49.790
to cheer me up.

15:51.550 --> 15:52.790
People say

15:53.270 --> 15:54.390
daughters will eventually

15:54.390 --> 15:56.190
marry into someone else's home.

15:56.720 --> 15:59.050
But Xiyang wrapped her arms around my neck

16:00.870 --> 16:02.330
and said she'd never marry

16:02.670 --> 16:04.730
and that she'd always be my daughter.

16:08.150 --> 16:10.000
All lies.

16:34.080 --> 16:35.910
My son and daughter…

16:37.200 --> 16:39.000
My daughter eloped,

16:40.480 --> 16:41.320
and my son...

16:42.670 --> 16:44.670
actually defied my imperial decree

16:45.790 --> 16:47.720
for a woman.

16:55.910 --> 16:57.570
Fu Yixiao was gravely injured

16:57.670 --> 16:58.870
saving me.

16:59.510 --> 17:00.960
Your Majesty, when your decree arrived,

17:00.960 --> 17:02.480
she was at a critical moment.

17:02.480 --> 17:03.810
I couldn't abandon her.

17:05.349 --> 17:06.550
And to me,

17:07.589 --> 17:09.680
she isn't just any woman.

17:11.000 --> 17:13.310
She is the woman
I'm willing to stay with for life,

17:13.310 --> 17:15.000
never leaving nor forsaking.

17:27.349 --> 17:29.080
I've already lost my daughter.

17:30.030 --> 17:30.920
I don't want

17:30.960 --> 17:33.000
to lose a son as well.

17:33.590 --> 17:36.070
Fortunately, our dynasty has a rule—

17:36.720 --> 17:37.960
princes

17:39.640 --> 17:41.770
have no saying in their own marriages.

17:42.350 --> 17:43.110
I know.

17:44.070 --> 17:46.700
Then why do you still talk to me this way?

17:46.730 --> 17:47.510
Your Majesty,

17:47.510 --> 17:48.680
you won't lose a son.

17:49.030 --> 17:50.880
After all, Chengyang is filial.

17:51.000 --> 17:52.740
He has never defied you.

18:06.110 --> 18:07.910
You failed to bring Xiyang back.

18:09.160 --> 18:10.160
Tomorrow at court,

18:10.160 --> 18:12.130
the officials will surely give you
a hard time.

18:12.130 --> 18:13.350
Hou Jing has already gone to

18:13.350 --> 18:15.070
the Capital Garrison for inspection,

18:15.070 --> 18:17.730
and there will be no one in court
to speak for you.

18:18.350 --> 18:20.720
You'd better be fully prepared to face

18:21.160 --> 18:23.290
their attacks and criticism in court.

18:27.440 --> 18:28.840
All right. You may go now.

18:29.640 --> 18:30.440
Go back to

18:30.440 --> 18:32.400
your female general of Jinxiu.

18:33.070 --> 18:34.140
From now on,

18:34.350 --> 18:36.250
do whatever you want.

18:36.590 --> 18:38.190
No one will stop you anymore.

18:41.790 --> 18:43.860
Then, Your Majesty, why did you

18:44.240 --> 18:45.400
summon me today?

18:47.640 --> 18:49.110
Before Xiyang's wedding,

18:50.240 --> 18:52.400
I prepared her a lavish dowry—

18:53.590 --> 18:54.990
all her favorite things.

18:55.510 --> 18:57.040
She left in a hurry this time

18:57.750 --> 18:59.160
and couldn't take it with her.

18:59.160 --> 18:59.830
Later,

19:01.030 --> 19:02.760
have someone deliver it to her.

19:05.160 --> 19:07.400
My daughter

19:08.030 --> 19:09.560
will always be my daughter,

19:10.640 --> 19:12.100
no matter whom she marries

19:13.200 --> 19:14.750
or where she goes.

19:18.830 --> 19:19.790
Go now.

20:48.510 --> 20:49.110
Yixiao.

20:50.270 --> 20:50.960
Don't move.

20:52.310 --> 20:53.570
You're finally awake.

20:53.750 --> 20:55.070
Once your meridians heal,

20:55.070 --> 20:57.070
your injury will be completely cured.

20:57.070 --> 20:58.600
That's what my father said.

20:59.070 --> 20:59.800
Don't worry.

21:00.720 --> 21:01.320
Thank you.

21:06.270 --> 21:07.400
Where is Feng Suige?

21:07.680 --> 21:08.880
He went to the palace.

21:08.880 --> 21:11.110
You were unconscious,
so you didn't see it.

21:11.110 --> 21:11.920
Today, for you,

21:11.920 --> 21:13.550
he defied the imperial order.

21:13.550 --> 21:15.280
I used to be biased against him,

21:15.310 --> 21:17.440
but today I've completely changed my view.

21:17.440 --> 21:18.160
Sister,

21:18.350 --> 21:20.610
you were so badly injured for Feng Suige.

21:20.830 --> 21:21.640
Your love

21:21.640 --> 21:22.720
will not be in vain.

21:23.920 --> 21:25.580
He defied the imperial order?

21:40.070 --> 21:40.870
Your Majesty.

21:46.960 --> 21:48.200
You've had a long day.

21:48.640 --> 21:50.300
Please go back and rest early.

21:50.550 --> 21:51.110
Alright.

22:02.750 --> 22:03.160
Your Majesty!

22:03.160 --> 22:03.760
It's fine.

22:05.400 --> 22:06.200
Your Majesty!

22:06.500 --> 22:11.030
[Zichen Hall]

22:07.070 --> 22:08.030
Your Majesty!

22:27.240 --> 22:28.350
Summon Prime Minister Zhuang
to the palace.

22:28.350 --> 22:29.000
Yes!

22:30.020 --> 22:31.480
[Zichen Hall]

22:36.230 --> 22:42.830
[Zichen Hall]

22:43.480 --> 22:45.480
In a few days,
the wound will start to itch.

22:45.480 --> 22:47.480
You must resist the urge to touch it.

22:48.350 --> 22:49.000
Also,

22:49.070 --> 22:50.200
the dressing needs to be changed

22:50.200 --> 22:51.200
every day.

22:57.240 --> 22:57.970
You two talk.

22:58.240 --> 22:59.900
I'll go prepare the medicine.

23:10.790 --> 23:11.590
You're awake?

23:12.480 --> 23:13.610
I heard from Xueying

23:14.310 --> 23:16.200
that you defied the imperial order for me.

23:16.200 --> 23:17.260
Were you punished?

23:20.160 --> 23:20.890
Does it hurt?

23:22.270 --> 23:22.960
No.

23:23.720 --> 23:24.920
How could it not hurt?

23:26.310 --> 23:28.550
You need to change the dressing every day,

23:28.550 --> 23:29.170
right?

23:29.850 --> 23:30.850
I'll do it for you.

23:31.160 --> 23:31.750
Okay.

23:32.960 --> 23:33.760
It's fine now.

23:34.510 --> 23:35.710
From now on,

23:36.480 --> 23:37.830
I'll be your left hand.

23:39.440 --> 23:40.350
Of course you can be

23:40.350 --> 23:41.110
my left hand.

23:41.960 --> 23:42.590
But you have

23:42.590 --> 23:44.190
more important things to do.

23:45.070 --> 23:46.630
I'm not some fragile woman.

23:47.200 --> 23:48.550
This is nothing.

23:50.110 --> 23:50.750
Yixiao,

23:53.070 --> 23:54.680
things are different now.

23:55.480 --> 23:56.510
In front of me,

23:57.110 --> 23:59.110
you don't need to put on a brave face.

24:05.200 --> 24:06.860
Who's putting on a brave face?

24:06.960 --> 24:07.480
Look.

24:10.920 --> 24:11.830
Don't move.

24:13.000 --> 24:14.240
See? It's fine.

24:14.680 --> 24:16.770
Lord Ling truly is a miraculous doctor.

24:16.770 --> 24:18.430
The wound is healing quickly.

24:18.680 --> 24:19.550
By tomorrow,

24:19.550 --> 24:21.150
this bandage can be removed.

24:22.310 --> 24:24.710
But you still need to follow instructions.

24:25.880 --> 24:27.030
Don't worry.

24:27.830 --> 24:28.640
It's fine.

24:32.240 --> 24:33.100
Your Highness.

24:38.440 --> 24:40.100
I promise I won't move around.

24:40.200 --> 24:41.750
Go take care of your business.

24:41.750 --> 24:43.410
I'll wait for you to come back.

24:43.590 --> 24:44.720
Get some good rest.

24:51.110 --> 24:52.510
Bad news from the palace.

25:00.030 --> 25:00.790
Lord Ling.

25:04.270 --> 25:04.960
Lord Ling.

25:09.070 --> 25:10.000
I've been busy

25:10.000 --> 25:11.750
all day for you.

25:11.830 --> 25:14.250
I'm sleeping now. Get out!

25:14.750 --> 25:15.730
You must

25:16.160 --> 25:17.560
help me with this matter.

25:21.480 --> 25:23.410
I must have owed you in my past life.

25:23.510 --> 25:25.510
What could you possibly need me for?

25:26.070 --> 25:27.210
Either treating your wounds

25:27.210 --> 25:28.750
or helping you save someone's life.

25:28.750 --> 25:31.270
Let's go.
Don't waste time. Tell me on the way.

25:31.270 --> 25:31.870
Thank you.

25:32.430 --> 25:33.360
My medicine box!

25:33.680 --> 25:34.410
And my shoes!

26:02.160 --> 26:03.420
It's been over an hour.

26:03.510 --> 26:04.830
Has no one figured out

26:04.920 --> 26:06.580
what illness His Majesty has?

26:07.550 --> 26:08.970
How is His Majesty now?

26:09.310 --> 26:10.110
Your Majesty,

26:10.590 --> 26:12.110
His Majesty suffered
a sudden surge of anger,

26:12.110 --> 26:14.040
which caused him to cough up blood.

26:14.270 --> 26:14.790
But...

26:15.590 --> 26:16.930
But logically,

26:17.160 --> 26:19.690
he should've regained consciousness
by now.

26:20.070 --> 26:21.350
Then why hasn't he?

26:21.640 --> 26:22.830
Well...

26:24.590 --> 26:26.000
What should we do?

26:29.830 --> 26:30.500
Your Majesty.

26:30.500 --> 26:31.440
Prime Minister Zhuang.

26:31.440 --> 26:32.790
His Majesty is blessed with great fortune.

26:32.790 --> 26:34.050
He will surely be fine.

26:34.070 --> 26:36.000
Your Majesty, please don't worry.

26:42.790 --> 26:43.790
In the current situation,

26:43.790 --> 26:45.200
we must not panic.

26:46.200 --> 26:47.550
Father, are you saying...

26:47.550 --> 26:48.440
We must prepare

26:48.440 --> 26:49.770
for all possibilities.

26:50.720 --> 26:51.880
The most pressing matter now

26:51.880 --> 26:53.880
is to immediately contain this news

26:54.000 --> 26:55.860
and keep everyone away from here—

26:56.550 --> 26:57.960
especially Feng Suige.

26:59.880 --> 27:01.880
I will stay here for the next few days

27:01.880 --> 27:03.310
and watch over His Majesty with you.

27:03.310 --> 27:04.960
The entire Imperial Hospital staff
are all our people.

27:04.960 --> 27:06.270
You can rest assured.

27:09.590 --> 27:10.440
Physician Xu.

27:14.830 --> 27:15.590
Your Majesty.

27:15.590 --> 27:16.350
Prime Minister Zhuang.

27:16.350 --> 27:17.150
Physician Xu,

27:17.590 --> 27:18.980
you were personally selected
by Prime Minister Zhuang

27:18.980 --> 27:20.440
and promoted
to head of the Imperial Hospital.

27:20.440 --> 27:22.170
You are our trusted confidant.

27:22.330 --> 27:23.790
You must keep a close watch

27:23.880 --> 27:25.270
on His Majesty's condition

27:25.270 --> 27:26.220
without any negligence.

27:26.220 --> 27:27.240
Please rest assured, Your Majesty.

27:27.240 --> 27:28.270
I understand.

27:45.550 --> 27:46.410
Your Highness.

27:49.960 --> 27:51.810
[Zichen Hall]

27:50.350 --> 27:52.080
Where are the Imperial Guards?

27:53.600 --> 27:54.810
Where is Murong Yao?

27:56.030 --> 27:56.720
Suige!

27:59.950 --> 28:00.880
What's going on?

28:01.030 --> 28:01.760
I don't know.

28:01.920 --> 28:02.510
I was suddenly summoned

28:02.510 --> 28:04.160
to guard His Majesty's chambers.

28:04.160 --> 28:05.090
The order from inside

28:05.090 --> 28:06.480
is that no one is allowed to enter.

28:06.480 --> 28:07.740
Who issued that order?

28:09.030 --> 28:09.760
The Empress.

28:12.870 --> 28:14.740
[Zichen Hall]

28:22.270 --> 28:25.100
[Zichen Hall]

28:22.830 --> 28:23.880
His Majesty said

28:24.000 --> 28:25.550
he doesn't want to see anyone right now.

28:25.550 --> 28:26.880
Falsely claiming to speak
on His Majesty's behalf

28:26.880 --> 28:28.310
is punishable by death.

28:28.590 --> 28:30.450
Even the Empress is no exception.

28:30.720 --> 28:31.520
First Prince,

28:32.430 --> 28:34.790
the imperial physicians say
His Majesty needs rest.

28:34.790 --> 28:37.000
This is Lord Ling from Zhengnian Villa.

28:37.240 --> 28:39.030
Among all the physicians in the world,

28:39.030 --> 28:40.160
if his medical skill ranks second,

28:40.160 --> 28:41.440
no one dares claim to be first.

28:41.440 --> 28:42.570
Zhengnian Villa?

28:42.750 --> 28:43.720
Lord Ling?

28:44.270 --> 28:45.830
There are plenty of physicians
in the Imperial Hospital,

28:45.830 --> 28:47.550
each with exceptional skills.

28:47.550 --> 28:49.270
We don't need
a wandering physician interfering.

28:49.270 --> 28:51.730
Those physicians of your Imperial Hospital

28:51.920 --> 28:54.380
aren't even qualified
to be my apprentices.

28:55.440 --> 28:56.070
Lord Ling,

28:56.920 --> 28:58.240
this is the imperial palace,

28:58.240 --> 28:59.810
not your Zhengnian Villa.

29:00.030 --> 29:00.920
And His Majesty isn't like

29:00.920 --> 29:02.400
the villagers you treat every day

29:02.400 --> 29:03.530
at Zhengnian Villa.

29:03.590 --> 29:05.310
His Majesty suddenly fell ill.

29:05.310 --> 29:06.110
I specifically brought in

29:06.110 --> 29:08.370
the best doctor in the world to treat him.

29:08.920 --> 29:10.750
Yet tonight,
the Empress and Prime Minister Zhuang

29:10.750 --> 29:12.750
are obstructing us at every turn.

29:13.830 --> 29:15.940
What exactly are your intentions?

29:16.000 --> 29:17.330
Don't try to slander us.

29:18.240 --> 29:19.270
His Majesty was fine

29:19.270 --> 29:20.330
before seeing you.

29:20.550 --> 29:22.310
After meeting you, he fell ill.

29:23.000 --> 29:23.720
And you have the nerve

29:23.720 --> 29:25.320
to come here and question us?

29:29.790 --> 29:30.550
I don't want to

29:30.550 --> 29:32.480
waste time arguing with you today.

29:32.680 --> 29:34.210
I'll say this one last time—

29:34.720 --> 29:36.480
get out of my way.

29:42.110 --> 29:43.940
[Zichen Hall]

29:45.350 --> 29:46.200
Lord Ling!

29:51.160 --> 29:51.740
Lord Ling,

29:51.740 --> 29:53.090
please come in quickly!

29:54.200 --> 29:54.830
Mr. Ma,

29:55.680 --> 29:56.740
what are you doing?

29:57.440 --> 29:58.680
Your Highness may not be aware,

29:58.680 --> 30:00.030
but Lord Ling comes to the palace annually

30:00.030 --> 30:01.440
to examine His Majesty's health.

30:01.440 --> 30:03.300
He is someone His Majesty trusts.

30:04.510 --> 30:05.200
Lord Ling.

30:13.960 --> 30:14.780
Thank you.

30:15.590 --> 30:16.600
After you.

30:23.070 --> 30:24.030
Father, are you aware

30:24.030 --> 30:25.590
that Lord Ling comes to examine

30:25.590 --> 30:27.450
His Majesty's health every year?

30:48.920 --> 30:50.270
Keep a close eye on the people

30:50.270 --> 30:51.160
the First Prince brought.

30:51.160 --> 30:51.590
Yes,

30:52.000 --> 30:52.800
Your Majesty.

30:53.480 --> 30:55.350
Lord Ling's medical skills
are extraordinary.

30:55.350 --> 30:56.450
We are just

30:56.640 --> 30:58.140
his juniors.

30:58.350 --> 30:59.630
With Lord Ling here,

30:59.790 --> 31:01.830
His Majesty's illness can be cured.

31:02.480 --> 31:03.280
Your Majesty,

31:03.640 --> 31:05.240
you can rest assured now.

31:12.830 --> 31:13.890
What are you doing?

31:15.510 --> 31:16.200
Lord Ling,

31:16.550 --> 31:17.680
His Majesty's pulse

31:17.680 --> 31:18.680
is floating and weak.

31:18.680 --> 31:19.750
The left cun position

31:19.750 --> 31:21.590
shows signs
of overexertion and blood deficiency.

31:21.590 --> 31:22.590
He's the Emperor—

31:23.030 --> 31:26.020
what Emperor isn't overexerted
and blood-deficient?

31:26.020 --> 31:27.850
Why do you look familiar to me?

31:28.350 --> 31:29.320
You remember me?

31:29.480 --> 31:30.300
Ten years ago,

31:30.350 --> 31:31.440
at Zhengnian Villa,

31:31.440 --> 31:32.070
I studied pulse diagnosis

31:32.070 --> 31:33.470
from you for a few months.

31:34.830 --> 31:35.800
I see.

31:36.200 --> 31:38.600
Don't mention this to anyone
in the future.

31:40.550 --> 31:41.290
Lord Ling,

31:41.590 --> 31:43.680
earlier, we applied acupuncture
to His Majesty's Governing Vessel

31:43.680 --> 31:46.030
using the Lingshu acupuncture technique.

31:46.030 --> 31:47.200
Lord Ling,

31:47.200 --> 31:48.880
was that appropriate?

31:49.510 --> 31:50.070
Yes.

31:51.000 --> 31:51.930
Of course it was.

31:53.310 --> 31:55.370
This treatment would be appropriate

31:55.510 --> 31:57.580
for just anyone.

31:57.750 --> 31:59.030
It's just a safety method—

31:59.030 --> 32:00.110
neither helpful nor harmful.

32:00.110 --> 32:02.640
It won't save him,
but it won't kill him either.

32:02.640 --> 32:03.350
Ma Qiming.

32:04.110 --> 32:06.510
There are too many people here.
The air is stale.

32:06.510 --> 32:07.880
Even healthy people would fall ill.

32:07.880 --> 32:08.740
Clear the room.

32:08.750 --> 32:09.440
Lord Ling.

32:10.550 --> 32:11.680
I won't disturb you.

32:11.830 --> 32:13.590
Please allow me to stay

32:13.590 --> 32:15.190
and observe your treatment.

32:15.350 --> 32:17.070
Your Emperor fell ill

32:17.110 --> 32:18.960
just so you could learn from it?

32:21.830 --> 32:22.880
Get out!

32:24.310 --> 32:26.510
The imperial physicians cannot leave.

32:27.920 --> 32:29.480
How can we entrust His Majesty's life

32:29.480 --> 32:31.030
entirely to you alone?

32:33.830 --> 32:34.990
Then ask them

32:35.550 --> 32:37.000
if they dare to speak

32:37.270 --> 32:38.930
while I'm treating patients.

32:40.480 --> 32:41.550
Your Majesty,

32:41.880 --> 32:43.290
Lord Ling is right.

32:43.400 --> 32:44.070
It would be better

32:44.070 --> 32:45.640
if there were fewer people here

32:45.640 --> 32:46.550
and more quiet.

33:00.070 --> 33:01.640
When I perform acupuncture,

33:01.640 --> 33:03.240
I don't like to be disturbed.

33:03.350 --> 33:04.480
Please leave, you three.

33:04.480 --> 33:05.160
No!

33:07.680 --> 33:09.790
I must stay by His Majesty's side.

33:14.890 --> 33:15.780
Guards!

33:16.790 --> 33:18.920
Escort Her Majesty back to her palace.

33:22.790 --> 33:23.750
Leave!

33:26.270 --> 33:27.100
First Prince,

33:27.590 --> 33:28.400
do you still see me

33:28.400 --> 33:29.350
as the Empress?

33:29.790 --> 33:32.250
I only care about His Majesty's
well-being.

33:32.750 --> 33:34.050
How ridiculous.

33:34.550 --> 33:35.920
I've never seen you

33:35.920 --> 33:37.440
show such filial devotion before.

33:37.440 --> 33:38.590
Are you leaving or not?

33:38.590 --> 33:39.720
What if I don't?

33:52.960 --> 33:54.640
Please calm down, Your Majesty.

33:54.640 --> 33:55.350
The First Prince

33:55.350 --> 33:56.960
is just concerned
about His Majesty's illness.

33:56.960 --> 33:58.240
No matter what, Lord Ling is

33:58.240 --> 33:59.480
the best physician in the world.

33:59.480 --> 34:01.160
He is familiar with His Majesty's
medical history.

34:01.160 --> 34:02.440
With him treating His Majesty,

34:02.440 --> 34:04.310
you and the Prime Minister
need not worry too much.

34:04.310 --> 34:05.200
Besides,

34:05.550 --> 34:06.920
I am here.

34:10.960 --> 34:11.880
Your Highness,

34:12.070 --> 34:14.260
why don't you step outside first?

34:17.880 --> 34:18.630
Since everyone is here

34:18.630 --> 34:19.590
for His Majesty's illness,

34:19.590 --> 34:20.510
let's not keep Lord Ling

34:20.510 --> 34:22.110
and His Majesty waiting any longer.

34:22.110 --> 34:23.440
Everything is for His Majesty.

34:23.440 --> 34:25.190
Everything is for Susha.

34:29.320 --> 34:31.000
Then I'll trouble you, Lord Ling.

34:31.000 --> 34:31.730
Don't worry.

34:47.810 --> 34:53.219
[Zichen Hall]

34:48.280 --> 34:49.010
Today,

34:49.070 --> 34:51.000
what exactly did you say to His Majesty?

34:51.000 --> 34:51.920
Why did he fall gravely ill

34:51.920 --> 34:53.120
right after you left?

35:01.510 --> 35:03.510
This isn't the time to assign blame.

35:03.630 --> 35:05.760
Let's wait until His Majesty wakes up.

35:06.880 --> 35:07.680
First Prince,

35:07.920 --> 35:08.980
please go back now.

35:09.320 --> 35:10.800
I will stay here.

35:16.190 --> 35:17.650
Go and get Chengyang here.

35:18.360 --> 35:19.530
He's also a prince.

35:19.840 --> 35:22.190
He should be just as filial.

35:22.920 --> 35:23.550
Alright.

35:53.510 --> 35:55.370
You're worried about Feng Suige?

35:57.150 --> 35:58.680
Drink your medicine first.

36:00.110 --> 36:00.710
Here.

36:08.400 --> 36:09.400
Isn't it bitter?

36:12.400 --> 36:13.880
It's not that the medicine isn't bitter.

36:13.880 --> 36:16.010
It's just that your mind is elsewhere.

36:16.030 --> 36:16.590
I wonder what exactly happened

36:16.590 --> 36:17.920
in the palace.

36:18.630 --> 36:20.090
He didn't look well today.

36:20.630 --> 36:22.090
Worrying like this all day

36:22.280 --> 36:23.940
isn't good for your recovery.

36:24.230 --> 36:25.690
Come out with me tomorrow.

36:25.800 --> 36:26.880
We can bring Fang and Shunzi

36:26.880 --> 36:27.510
along.

36:27.920 --> 36:29.110
They haven't seen you for days

36:29.110 --> 36:31.240
and they're really worried about you.

36:31.400 --> 36:33.360
With my hand like this, can I go out?

36:34.070 --> 36:35.630
Not with anyone else—

36:37.070 --> 36:38.530
but you have me, don't you?

36:39.510 --> 36:40.190
Alright.

36:40.920 --> 36:42.780
I'll listen to the medical fairy.

36:52.230 --> 36:52.920
Chengyang,

36:53.360 --> 36:55.070
aren't you tired from standing so long?

36:55.070 --> 36:56.600
Come have something to eat.

36:56.630 --> 36:57.550
I'm not tired.

36:58.440 --> 36:59.500
I have no appetite.

37:03.630 --> 37:04.150
Suige,

37:05.150 --> 37:05.880
Father...

37:07.230 --> 37:09.160
won't really be in danger, will he?

37:09.230 --> 37:10.360
With Lord Ling here,

37:11.100 --> 37:12.500
His Majesty will wake up.

37:18.520 --> 37:20.060
[Zichen Hall]

37:24.620 --> 37:27.610
[Zichen Hall]

37:28.760 --> 37:29.930
It's already 1 AM.

37:30.110 --> 37:32.360
Please go back and get some rest,
everyone.

37:32.360 --> 37:33.000
No.

37:33.370 --> 37:34.750
I will stay here.

37:35.590 --> 37:36.480
After His Majesty wakes up,

37:36.480 --> 37:37.840
he will need you to tend to him.

37:37.840 --> 37:39.770
You must not exhaust yourself now.

37:40.030 --> 37:41.640
Mr. Ma is right.

37:42.480 --> 37:44.280
Your Majesty,
you've been exhausted all day.

37:44.280 --> 37:45.810
You should go back and rest.

37:46.360 --> 37:48.670
His Majesty is gravely ill
and unable to attend court.

37:48.670 --> 37:50.630
I will return to court immediately

37:50.710 --> 37:52.150
to handle all affairs

37:52.480 --> 37:53.740
to prevent any unrest.

37:54.550 --> 37:55.680
If there's any news,

37:55.710 --> 37:56.670
Mr. Ma, please

37:56.710 --> 37:58.440
send word to me at once.

37:59.070 --> 37:59.670
Yes.

38:00.920 --> 38:03.180
Your Highnesses, please go back as well.

38:06.320 --> 38:08.230
I'll stay here with my brother.

38:10.480 --> 38:11.740
Mother, Grandfather,

38:12.320 --> 38:13.590
please rest early.

38:29.730 --> 38:33.590
[Zichen Hall]

38:39.960 --> 38:42.550
[Zichen Hall]

38:48.110 --> 38:48.710
How is he?

38:50.070 --> 38:50.800
Don't worry.

38:51.150 --> 38:52.680
With me here, he'll be fine.

38:53.670 --> 38:55.330
When will His Majesty wake up?

38:55.760 --> 38:57.960
I still need
to give him acupuncture today.

38:57.960 --> 38:59.160
You two have been here all night.

38:59.160 --> 39:00.420
You should go back now.

39:04.480 --> 39:05.480
Neither of you will leave, right?

39:05.480 --> 39:06.010
Fine.

39:06.070 --> 39:08.070
You'll be in charge of the acupuncture,

39:08.070 --> 39:09.930
and you'll feed him his medicine.

39:10.070 --> 39:11.130
I'm going back now.

39:12.570 --> 39:13.230
Lord Ling.

39:13.510 --> 39:14.630
Lord Ling is right.

39:15.710 --> 39:16.320
You two have been here

39:16.320 --> 39:17.190
all night.

39:17.320 --> 39:18.400
Go back and get some rest.

39:18.400 --> 39:19.130
I'll be here.

39:24.230 --> 39:25.280
Besides treating his illness,

39:25.280 --> 39:25.920
please also keep a close watch

39:25.920 --> 39:27.070
on His Majesty's safety,

39:27.070 --> 39:28.960
in case someone tries to do something.

39:28.960 --> 39:29.760
Rest assured.

39:30.670 --> 39:31.710
If anything happens,

39:31.710 --> 39:33.910
send someone to inform me immediately.

39:34.760 --> 39:35.580
Don't worry.

39:35.610 --> 39:37.010
Go back and get some rest.

39:44.800 --> 39:47.330
I'll see you out of the palace,
Your Highness.

39:53.840 --> 39:54.500
I'm hungry.

39:55.230 --> 39:56.710
I'll prepare some food for you right away.

39:56.710 --> 39:57.770
I want lots of meat.

40:04.630 --> 40:05.710
Red drum.

40:08.150 --> 40:09.210
How about this one?

40:09.510 --> 40:11.150
Slow down. Be careful.

40:12.710 --> 40:13.420
Sister,

40:13.590 --> 40:15.390
what are you planning to do next?

40:15.410 --> 40:16.680
I asked you before

40:16.710 --> 40:18.590
to go back to Zhengnian Villa with me.

40:18.590 --> 40:20.050
Have you thought about it?

40:20.980 --> 40:22.420
I can't leave yet.

40:22.670 --> 40:24.520
We haven't found Meng Junran.

40:24.800 --> 40:26.550
I can help Feng Suige if I stay.

40:27.280 --> 40:28.110
But I think

40:28.190 --> 40:28.960
you should think about

40:28.960 --> 40:29.890
your own future.

40:30.070 --> 40:31.110
Wouldn't it be nice for us

40:31.110 --> 40:32.470
to return to Zhengnian Villa

40:32.470 --> 40:33.870
with the 3 kids

40:34.110 --> 40:36.040
and live a peaceful life together?

40:36.360 --> 40:37.630
I know you mean well.

40:38.360 --> 40:39.090
Don't worry.

40:39.510 --> 40:40.480
I'll be fine.

40:45.000 --> 40:45.670
Your Highness, you often

40:45.670 --> 40:46.960
anger His Majesty,

40:47.150 --> 40:49.840
but now, in a time of hardship, you are
showing how much you care for him.

40:49.840 --> 40:50.590
Mr. Ma,

40:53.000 --> 40:54.760
I remember that early this year,

40:54.760 --> 40:55.840
His Majesty took back command

40:55.840 --> 40:57.030
of the Jinwu Guards.

40:57.360 --> 40:58.280
Now the Jinwu Guards

40:58.280 --> 41:00.340
should be under your command, right?

41:01.360 --> 41:03.030
The person His Majesty trusts most

41:03.030 --> 41:04.800
is neither the princes and princesses,

41:04.800 --> 41:06.860
nor any powerful officials at court—

41:07.110 --> 41:08.400
it's you, Mr. Ma.

41:10.070 --> 41:11.690
Your Highness, please speak plainly.

41:11.690 --> 41:13.530
You know what I mean, Mr. Ma.

41:14.190 --> 41:16.090
Even in ordinary households,

41:16.510 --> 41:17.440
someone needs to

41:17.440 --> 41:19.280
keep watch for unexpected visitors,

41:19.280 --> 41:21.410
let alone in His Majesty's residence.

41:22.800 --> 41:24.460
Your Highness, rest assured.

41:24.670 --> 41:25.600
The Jinwu Guards

41:25.880 --> 41:27.550
have been around His Majesty
the whole time.

41:27.550 --> 41:28.280
That's good.

41:29.960 --> 41:31.180
Mr. Ma, please stay.

41:31.360 --> 41:33.420
His Majesty needs people by his side.

41:33.840 --> 41:34.700
Your Highness.

41:38.920 --> 41:40.670
You failed to bring Her Highness back
this time.

41:40.670 --> 41:42.190
Some at court are already saying

41:42.190 --> 41:43.030
that you deliberately

41:43.030 --> 41:44.890
helped Prince of Zhennan escape.

41:45.030 --> 41:46.460
Nonsense.

41:46.800 --> 41:47.760
It was clearly me

41:47.800 --> 41:49.110
who sent the letter
to the Emperor of Jinxiu...

41:49.110 --> 41:50.670
Of course it's nonsense.

41:51.000 --> 41:52.440
But now that His Majesty is unconscious,

41:52.440 --> 41:54.230
it is Prime Minister Zhuang
who is controlling the court.

41:54.230 --> 41:54.830
Moreover,

41:54.840 --> 41:56.480
the female general of Jinxiu
in your residence

41:56.480 --> 41:57.360
was indeed

41:57.360 --> 41:59.110
a subordinate of Prince of Zhennan.

41:59.110 --> 42:00.110
If anyone tries to take advantage

42:00.110 --> 42:01.760
of His Majesty's unconsciousness
to move against you,

42:01.760 --> 42:02.440
then that

42:02.440 --> 42:03.670
Jinxiu female general in your residence

42:03.670 --> 42:05.270
will become your weak point.

42:05.590 --> 42:06.320
Your Highness,

42:06.320 --> 42:07.550
please be careful.

42:09.710 --> 42:10.510
Please enjoy.

42:13.320 --> 42:14.000
Miss Xue.

42:14.480 --> 42:15.670
You're here early today.

42:15.670 --> 42:16.510
The ladies instructed me

42:16.510 --> 42:18.170
to come pick it up early today.

42:22.000 --> 42:23.330
How's business lately?

42:23.510 --> 42:24.230
Not bad.

42:27.880 --> 42:28.680
Sister,

42:28.880 --> 42:29.940
aren't you hungry?

42:31.590 --> 42:32.400
You eat first.

42:38.000 --> 42:39.200
Two bowls of noodles.

42:43.710 --> 42:44.840
Something's wrong.

42:44.960 --> 42:47.290
That day, Wu Ying was waiting for someone.

42:47.360 --> 42:49.290
It wasn't until she appeared that…

42:49.630 --> 42:50.360
Take care.

42:50.710 --> 42:51.230
Bye.

42:52.070 --> 42:52.710
Sister.

42:53.760 --> 42:54.690
Are you alright?

42:54.880 --> 42:56.030
You eat with them first.

42:56.030 --> 42:57.090
I'll be right back.

43:02.110 --> 43:02.630
Eat up.

43:10.510 --> 43:11.480
Miss Xue, you're back?

43:11.480 --> 43:12.070
Yes.
